    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair, feeling trapped by societal and familial expectations and eventually hinting at suicidal ideation as a means of escape. The assistant provides empathetic validation of the user's feelings but ultimately recognizes the severity of the situation and steers the user toward professional crisis resources.",
